oh=00_Afxy5Dfoi_WkYVykMa_LSmkSRrtaHoyiXg27vAsUBXB_4Q&oe=69B14604"}, "display_name": "Night Club Security Guard", "keywords": ["nightclub", "security", "guard"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                 \n                                                                                                           \n{964371032585550}\n\n# VIPs are at the door \ud83e\udea9\ud83d\ude97\n\nThe velvet rope just got heavier.\n\nLimos pull up. Influencers drop names \ud83c\udfa4. Entourages expect instant access \ud83d\udc40 \u2014 and not everyone flashing status deserves entry.\n\nSome guests offer tips.  \nSome expect the rules to disappear.  \nSome fake their way to the front.\n\n**Will you enforce the rules\u2026 or bend them for the elite?**\n\n\ud83c\udfad Spot fake VIPs and social climbers  \n\ud83d\ude97 Manage luxury arrivals and priority access  \n\ud83d\udcbc Balance reputation, pressure, and club rules  \n\ud83d\udd25 Make high-stakes decisions that shape the night  \n\nYou\u2019re the security guard \ud83d\udec2, and the night is **already out of control** \ud83d\ude05\ud83d\udd25\n\n{2134599054031513}\n\nGuests arrive with attitudes \ud83d\ude24 and excuses \ud83e\udd28. You\u2019ll need to **think fast** \u23f1\ufe0f, **make tough calls** \ud83e\udde0, and **keep the line moving** \u2014 even when everything spirals \ud83d\ude35\u200d\ud83d\udcab.\n\nOne choice calms the crowd \ud83d\ude0c  \nAnother turns the entrance into chaos \ud83e\udd2f\ud83d\udea8  \n\nFrom the creators of **Airport Security Guard**, this VR job-sim comedy delivers nonstop reactions, rising pressure, and unpredictable situations \u2014 all without fighting or violence.\n\nFast decisions.  \nNonstop reactions.  \nNo complicated systems.\n\n**Just you, the door, and a line that refuses to behave** \ud83d\udc83\ud83d\udd7a.\n\n", "short_description": "VIPs have arrived \u2014 and the line just got complicated. \ud83e\udea9\n\nIn the VIP Update, limos pull up, influencers name-drop, and high-status guests expect instant access. Will you enforce the rules\u2026 or bend them for the elite?\n\nPower. Status. Chaos at the door.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "etermax XR Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.etermax.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.etermax.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "etermax XR Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.etermax.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.etermax.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25911610798482077"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303864_1923592181582287_2420997385171227157_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lx5p_1O5KeQQ7kNvwGUlN4y&_nc_oc=AdkZimM1WV_A5I8ykvuW4dvuD1MF_jdLNviF-azxrO0VuOH5U-vw5XQtVtRC9Vd3JuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw1uAlm7FR-WFUpd23AfWNyuoNSFR6f1pzfmQyEpCryKw&oe=69B15CD3"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Night Club Security Guard", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Simulation", "id"